  "scope": "Retained C++ World factory, lazy CityHost/Home/Script/Help and shared Tooltip, CityPhysical and one Popup/People/facility-menu/Message/MPEffect coordinator. Native Message owns canonical globals, original modal/button/text/portrait lifecycle and retained repeat widgets. Shared native widget mouse includes actual Label input and Settings drag: captured vtable/clamp, same device held/release queries, indexed XOR outlines and actual Manager old/new invalidation. Native MPEffect borrows the original C++ construct/tick/draw bodies on212B scenes, actual Screen modal, same indexed background/assets/audio, original CRT globals and canonical overlay61E418. Godot Device/Display/audio/menu providers and explicit C++ Outer scheduling share the retained Runtime. WaitAny uses actual same-device message and key-queue operations. Missing business, interpreter and interaction children still reject; whole-city and whole-game completion remain unverified.",
  "helper_originals": [
    "restoration/build/sea-battle-combat/20261003T134913797614Z/pure_helper_bodies.cpp"
  ],
  "existing_body_consumers": {
    "restoration/src/land_owner_flow.cpp": "Standalone source graph TU. Native BattlePort connects actual44AA30/44A870/init/menu/turn/cleanup to same Owner Data/Window/Resources/Audio/Message/Help. Typed Windows lifetime and Pair capture preserve normal return versus interruption. Preflight4555B0 and Script-local Virtual leases are connected in source; whole battle execution remains unverified.",
    "restoration/src/land_value_flow.cpp": "Standalone source graph TU; native world_runtime_land borrows original CRT ctor and thirteen portable Data-only value/image/actor/skill helpers against canonical BSS, shared records and RNG, plus the actual446E80 name-table leaf. Sample/archive/remap/string-menu endpoints borrow surrounding physical consumers",
    "restoration/src/land_placement_flow.cpp": "Standalone source graph TU. Original36B non-scene controller, full defender generation/strength/count RNG/model/kind/location/ordering use canonical Data/records/RNG and actual Window points. Native typed scope retains exact Owner allocation; complete446E60/4A13F0/4A1470 and player modal4A02A0 connect in source. Virtual strength reads the same live global or admitted caller-local20B lease.",
    "restoration/src/land_player_flow.cpp": "Standalone source graph TU. Native Windows borrows player364B lifecycle/resources/render/selection/cache and twenty portable bodies. Ten actual164B cells and two84B Choice buttons use original tables, live root/sample state and actual Owner/Widgets/Input/Mouse/Capture. Generated root Manager input/full modal4A02A0 and complete placement callers connect in source; whole game execution remains unverified.",
    "restoration/src/duel_owner_flow.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes existing body once; native world_runtime_duel borrows AA700/A8500/resource initializer against one actual740B Owner scene, shared records/RNG/Message and actual samples/archive/palette; combat/render/timer consumers remain required",
    "restoration/src/facility_duel_flow.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes existing body once; native world_runtime_city_ui borrows the facility entry/restore wrapper against canonical Home/Popup/City and retains the actual AA700 child boundary",
    "restoration/src/facility_actor_access.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes exact body once at file scope",
    "restoration/src/mp_effect_flow.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes existing body once; native world_runtime_mp_effect borrows construct/tick/draw against the same Owner scene",
    "multiply_divide_or_minus_one_004b7b96/subtract_floor_zero_004b7bc7": "restoration/src/bounded_value.cpp owns existing identical bodies",
    "integer_square_root_004b7c2c": "restoration/build/godot-native/projection_constants.cpp owns existing identical body",
    "suffix_definitions": "godot/native/fleet_wear.cpp includes existing generated definitions",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_virtual.cpp": "Standalone source graph TU. Script, World land encounters and Land share exact non-scene20B Owner leases, original4C3718/4C3620 roles and defined-word metadata. Actual45FE10/45FF00/45FF10/45FF30/45FF40/45FF50/45FF80/45FF90/4501D0/450200/450220/450230/40C3C0 methods retain canonical actor/Fleet fields, clamps and real status refresh. Scope release is normal-return-only; interruption retains partial storage until joined-worker retirement.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_encounter.cpp": "Standalone source graph TU. Native48BE80 land selection runs before lazy UI, then same-owner Virtual, live strength/name/suffix, Message, terrain and Land44AA30 follow-up. Mode0 scans sixteen live status rows with mutable432470 projection and retained point, preserves duplicates and contact flag stores, connects native entity dialogue/variable triple-row Choice and actual relationship/approach/attack branches. No-contact terrain/region/RNG and81-patron selection precede lazy UI. Actual4435B0 enters the retained native Sea Runtime on the same worker, with exact Layout/Aux views shared by Owner/Bridge. Native48CC20 compacts live special-person roster entries, retains its typed stack participants through real Sea completion and only then performs audio/432400 first-status reset. Actual48CCF0 trade, unresolved nested Sea/UI children and navigation remain required completions. Header44AF40/60/70 retain exact BYTE/WORD and fresh post-audio flags. No execution/playability claim.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_sea_salvage.cpp": "Native434D30 salvage parent on actual shared Layout/Owner/Runtime. Live ship/status cleanup, two class/name reads, four supply/eight cargo rows, original signed quantity/capacity arithmetic and first matching-city catalog RNG prepare actual Owner buffers. Physical488A20 capture-management and4879A0/488880 loot lifecycle must complete; pending UI rejects without fake success. Parent tokens remain live on interruption; whole game remains incomplete.",
    "godot/native/fleet_mutiny.cpp": "Canonical Person275 initializer provider reused directly by native Fleet4751E0 and Script dialogue. Original master descriptor and14 helper bodies mutate actual284B record; independent legacy fleet_mutiny_step packet API is not the native coordinator.",
    "restoration/src/shipyard_purchase_flow.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes the existing portable body once. Native HomeRules ShipyardPort uses the same actual Player824/City92/Ship108/Fleet312 backing and live RNG. Canonical Facility6 entry/menu, original hull selection, naming Settings, media, Account and crew/cargo children now connect through the shared Owner/Coordinator. Native sale/repair also reuse this Port. Customization now has native cannon/figure selectors and the360B sail preview; no execution/playability claim.",
    "restoration/src/shipyard_sale_flow.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes the existing body once. Native same-record ShipyardPort now implements frozen sales, actual236B multi-selector/header/footer and native184B CargoEditor, real Account/crew/Header callbacks and ordered world settlement. No independent Session import or execution/playability claim.",
    "restoration/src/shipyard_repair_flow.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes the existing body once. Native same-record ShipyardPort connects44B9C0 to the existing200B five-column ship selector46C3E0, shared549D60 category, actual same-owner candidate/output arrays, fresh damage/RNG/city/cash reads and live maximum setters. No execution/playability claim.",
    "restoration/src/shipyard_customization_flow.cpp": "godot/native/city_facility.cpp includes the existing body once. Native same-record ShipyardPort connects496960 to actual ship selection, shared56E290/61D254/61D260 UI state, original menus/numeric/award, ten original rule branches and native cannon/figurehead selectors. Figurehead uses the actual192B child/176B parent, original CRT image dimensions, borrowed prices, live selection and same-owner ITEM pixels. The native360B ShipPreview retains five Sample20 buffers, actual Ship108/sail fields, original PE banks/dimensions, same-owner ShipStil archive decoding/palette/Screen and original begin/update/end order. Both preview guards/positions share the same Factory BSS. No execution/playability claim.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_market.cpp": "Canonical Market176/51A110, original entry/menu/buy/sell and contract evidence items on the same Owner, Calendar, Actor bank, ItemList, Inspection and award services. C++ source only; no execution or whole-game claim.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_patron_facility.cpp": "Palace200/519F80 and Church216/519FD0 reuse same Owner Expert contract/report/payment/exchange/proposal/leave settlement. Actual5/6 row menus, Palace100-percent admission and gender dialogue, Church embedded+C4 learning, original BSS and native physical services. Source only; no execution/whole-game claim.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_gate.cpp": "Canonical Gate184/519E90 entry, original3-row menu, confirmation/abandon and10-day cleanup/crew/position restoration. Shared Port/Gate high-fame opponent275 and duel5, reference4A56F0 and war46ABB0 menus, actual land battle/city ownership, negotiation/bribe/imprisonment/escape/cash/Header/A0 settlement now connected on same records/RNG/Owner. Source only; no facility/whole-game execution claim.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_departure.cpp": "Canonical Port184 retained across City visits. Original common entry/menu, all eight menu choices, mode0 notice and nonzero4770A0 reference/war/10-day/Fleet-flag/City-state/hostile-sponsor release are source-connected through shared Owner/Calendar/typed dialogue/native services. Final contract notice follows actual nonzero result. Shared settlement accepts only original same-caller receiver or legacy receiver0. Full facility and whole-game execution remain unverified.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_media_resolver.cpp": "Original425350 local-preference and actual installed-media missing-root/missing-file Message retry on the same Owner worker; owned UTF8 transport retains current consumer release ABI. Hardware CD enumeration and shared586170 identity are platform adaptations, not execution equivalence.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_samples.cpp": "Original4248A0 retry formatter/Window/RetryCancel/shutdown on the retained worker; same callback now serves Status, Data, Source, Bootstrap, City and UI sample allocations. Actual Godot Window HWND is queried on engine, the Win32 system warning runs on worker with cancellation-safe creation hook; original game state and descriptor stay live. Source only, no gameplay execution.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_godot_view.cpp": "Same native_world.gd display: C++ creates/adopts actual SubViewport and two TextureRects, checks parent/Script/ObjectID and property identity, assigns actual viewport texture, configures nearest scale/ignore mouse and rollback. No game state/upload/readback/ACK synthesis or execution claim.",
    "godot/native/world_runtime_godot_files.cpp": "Actual user:// startup file transport: preserve CDS/TMP/exact companion, copy original bytes to owned new stages, flush and promote by handles without replacement, rollback only owned handles. Original load/version/recovery stays on the retained worker; no execution claim."
  }
